WEBVTT

1
00:00:33.576 --> 00:00:34.762
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> Can I help you?

2
00:00:35.428 --> 00:00:38.238
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes, what size is this shirt?

3
00:00:38.595 --> 00:00:39.440
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> Let’s see.

4
00:00:42.234 --> 00:00:45.060
It’s a small. What size do you need?

5
00:00:45.726 --> 00:00:47.042
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> A medium.

6
00:00:47.773 --> 00:00:48.585
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> Just a moment.

7
00:01:06.079 --> 00:01:08.873
This is a medium.

8
00:01:10.465 --> 00:01:11.537
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thank you.

9
00:01:13.438 --> 00:01:14.689
Can I try it on?

10
00:01:15.062 --> 00:01:18.084
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> Of course. The changing rooms are over there.

11
00:01:19.984 --> 00:01:20.683
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thank you.

12
00:01:58.612 --> 00:01:59.603
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> How is it?

13
00:02:00.204 --> 00:02:01.454
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It’s great.

14
00:02:03.209 --> 00:02:05.304
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> It’s a very nice shirt.

15
00:02:06.928 --> 00:02:08.098
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> How much is it?

16
00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:10.567
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> It’s forty-four ninety-nine.

17
00:02:11.396 --> 00:02:17.861
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Great. Thank you.

18
00:02:18.283 --> 00:02:19.193
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> Thank you.

19
00:02:19.826 --> 00:02:20.492
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Bye.